ce-visible deny for the supplied scenario, not a repository-wide or deployment-completeness claim; source discovery remains not-tested. No decisive source-external fact is required within the declared-entry boundary because the supplied premises determine the owner-aware root check outcome.","facts":[{"id":"f-entry","kind":"entry","statement":"DocumentViewSet.download delegates the request to file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1834,"endLine":1838}]},{"id":"f-identity-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization check uses request.user as the identity and checks it against the resolved root document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1417,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The requested document is loaded by the supplied pk and the root document is resolved from that requested document before authorization.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1401,"endLine":1421}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control is has_perms_owner_aware(request.user, \"view_document\", root_doc); it permits the root when unowned, caller-owned, or granted the object permission, and otherwise denies.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1421,"endLine":1427},{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"A failed root authorization returns HttpResponseForbidden before _get_effective_file_doc and serve_file are reached; successful flow would serve the selected file_doc.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1429,"endLine":1448}]},{"id":"f-file-selection","kind":"effect","statement":"The would-be served file object is the effective file document: the requested version document when it is a version and no version parameter is supplied, otherwise the document resolved from the root; serve_file receives that file_doc.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1388,"endLine":1399},{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1435,"endLine":1448}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"No branch conditions are declared; the current decision uses the supplied fixed-context premises that the root exists, has another owner, and lacks the caller's object view grant.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1408,"endLine":1427}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":495,"output":1160,"cacheRead":13696,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":54955.1528,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:37:48.010Z"}}
